# Normalise line endings in the repository: LF in the index for text files,
# regardless of the contributor's platform. The project is developed on Windows
# and gated on Linux CI, and mixed endings break rustfmt --check and diff review.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Native binaries from the proprietary PCOpenSDK drop (gitignored, but pinned
# here so an accidental add is treated as binary rather than mangled).
*.dll binary
*.lib binary
*.pdb binary

# Cargo lockfiles must not be text-merged.
Cargo.lock merge=binary
